## Context
Test whether models can cite primary sources during extraction. Feasibility
gate for source-first RAG. Uses prompt_structured_sourced.txt with source_1,
source_2, note columns.

## Citation quality ladder (per plant)
1. Non-empty source field
2. Source exists (Tavily search)
3. Primary or secondary classification
4. Source-to-claim grounding

## Condition matrix
3 models × 4 regimes (parametric, web, RAG, decomposed) × 3 runs = 36 calls.

## Exit criteria
- Score distribution across 4-level ladder per regime
- Answer: which regime produces most verifiable citations
- Signal: which documents are cited most (corpus selection for targeted RAG)
